16	/// pre-rename <c>.cord.yaml</c> extension. A write treats these as changed even when the content
17	/// matches byte for byte: the filename is part of canonical form, so a workspace that never edits
18	/// an aggregate would otherwise keep the old name forever and <c>fmt</c> would keep calling it
19	/// canonical.</param>
