                 "the related-apps block asks which records in OTHER installed applications point "
                 + "at this one. A standalone build has no other installed applications, so the "
                 + "block has nothing to look through. This is not a feature waiting to be added: "
                 + "the question only has an answer where a company runs several applications on "
                 + "shared people and organizations, which is what Cordango Platform does"),
            ]),

